<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines limits banks' exposure to property.</title>
<headline>Philippines limits banks' exposure to property.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank has set a 20 percent limit on loan exposure of banks to the real estate sector, Central Bank governor Gabriel Singson said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
